The module deliberately implements a small, explicit profile.  It does not
load an authored expected IR and it does not infer missing evidence, review,
package, or accounting metadata.  Callers provide those facts through
``CompileBindings``.  ``core0_frontends_v1`` supplies the textual parser; this
module is also the typed-library entrypoint.
"""

